From: Scott Jones <scottajones@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:16:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm: apple: use the Aurora boot flow on T8142

T8142 (M5) gets the generic Apple defaults: "bootflow scan -b" over NVMe
and USB, with "usb start" as preboot. Give it the Aurora flow the A18
Pro, M4, M4 Pro, M4 Max and M5 Max already use: the removable-media EFI
path on the internal ESP first, then the loader's fallback image, then
bootflow on NVMe only.

The flow doesn't start the MTP keyboard on T8142. The J813 can't restart
its MTP firmware once U-Boot stops it, and a warm handoff isn't
qualified on the J704 or J815. Keeping the MTP driver itself off on
every T8142 is #51's change.

The gate is the SoC compatible, like every other SoC in this list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm/mach-apple/board.c | 10 +++++++---
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm/mach-apple/board.c b/arch/arm/mach-apple/board.c
index d161e8822c..f0455145b6 100644
--- a/arch/arm/mach-apple/board.c
+++ b/arch/arm/mach-apple/board.c
@@ -1501,8 +1501,8 @@ char *env_fat_get_dev_part(void)
 #define lmb_alloc(size, addr) lmb_alloc_mem(LMB_MEM_ALLOC_ANY, SZ_2M, addr, size, LMB_NONE)
 
 /*
- * Aurora Silicon boot flow for J700 (T8140), J713 (T8132), J616s (T6040) and
- * J714c (T6050).
+ * Aurora Silicon boot flow for J700 (T8140), J713 (T8132), J616s (T6040),
+ * J714c (T6050) and the M5 (T8142).
  *
  * m1n1 hands U-Boot the Linux devicetree it prepared, with the kernel
  * command line in /chosen/bootargs.  First load the removable-media EFI
@@ -1707,6 +1707,9 @@ int board_late_init(void)
 	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t6041") ||
 	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t6050"))
 		start_keyboard = false;
+	/* T8142 MTP firmware can't be restarted after U-Boot stops it (J813). */
+	if (of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t8142"))
+		start_keyboard = false;
 	/* A helper the OS adopts running is started for U-Boot's keyboard too. */
 	if (apple_rtkit_helper_any_keeps_running() ||
 	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,j613") ||
@@ -1714,7 +1717,8 @@ int board_late_init(void)
 	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t8132") ||
 	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t6040") ||
 	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t6041") ||
-	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t6050"))
+	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t6050") ||
+	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t8142"))
 		apple_efi_late_init(start_keyboard);
 	else
 		apple_typec_late_init();
